<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Concorde Travel says negotiations continue.</title>
<headline>Concorde Travel says negotiations continue.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Concorde Travel Holdings Ltd said on Tuesday it was still in talks which could have an impact on its share price and urged shareholders to exercise caution in their dealings.</p>
<p>It first announced it was in talks on October 7.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
